   \( 0.5 \text{ mg/kg/min} \times 14.54 \text{ kg} = 7.27 \text{ mg/min} \).  
   \( \text{Time} = \frac{290.8 \text{ mg}}{7.27 \text{ mg/min}} = 40.1 \text{ min} \).

