  - Molecular weight = 900 g/mol  
  - Carbon: \( 68.18\% = \frac{12 \times 100}{900} = 14.88 \approx 15 \) C  
  - Hydrogen: \( 13.16\% = \frac{2 \times 100}{900} = 2.84 \approx 3 \) H  
