### Step 2: Understand the PWP Functional
The PWP (PWP8A) functional is a periodic-periodic approach to electronic structure theory. It is designed to accurately describe transition metal complexes, especially those with strong electron-electron interactions. It is known to provide accurate results for transition metal complexes, including Cu(CO₂)₂.

