8. **Conditional Mass Function Theorem**: $\mathcal{P}(X = x, Y = y) = \mathcal{P}(X = x|Y = y) \cdot \mathcal{P}(Y = y)$.
9. **Conditional Density Function Theorem**: $\mathcal{P}(X = x, Y = y) = \mathcal{P}(X = x|Y = y) \cdot \mathcal{P}(Y = y)$.

