","To calculate the average radiation dose to the liver, we need to convert the energy absorbed into a dose unit (e.g., mGy or mSv). The conversion factor between energy absorbed (in J) and dose (in mGy) is given by the mass-energy conversion factor (1 g/cm²/J).

